# Routing (LFO again, after Drift): the selected track's Drift, In or Bypass. At Bypass the track goes
# past Chaos, Motion and Mutate: no glitch on it, its filter at rest, its mutes its own. Space stays.
wait 200
tap LFO
expect view 9
tap LFO
expect view 10
# the kick: In by default; turned down, Bypass (the B on its row)
expect tpar24 1
spin K1 -1
expect tpar24 0
shot routing.png
# every track past it: Mutate at full plays no quarter
tap OCT+
spin K1 -1
expect tpar24 0
tap OCT+
spin K1 -1
tap OCT+
spin K1 -1
tap OCT+
expect track 4
expect apar27 1
spin K1 -1
expect apar27 0
tap LFO
expect view 9
spin K3 100
expect gpar18 100
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect mutates 0
expect mutediff 0
# the acid line in again: Mutate plays with it
tap LFO
expect view 10
spin K1 1
expect apar27 1
wait 10000
expect mutates >0
shot routing_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 50
expect mutediff 0
expect dropped 0
